  "daily_overview": "今日科技界聚焦 AI Agent 的落地与安全风控，Meta 与阿里等巨头正通过开源手册及多模态硬件加速商业闭环，然而 AI 模型面临的安全测试造假与泄露挑战引发了各国监管层的严正警惕。财经领域显示，尽管全球利率攀升，AI 产业投资热度依然强劲，但高盛分析提醒投资者需警惕宏观利率波动对资本市场的长期挤压。时政层面，中美在白宫峰会后就 AI 合作达成初步共识，但中东地区冲突持续、巴西选举与阿根廷经济困局等全球地缘风险点依然频发，这对全球经济稳定提出了新考验。\n\nToday's tech world focuses on the deployment and risk control of AI Agents, with tech giants like Meta and Alibaba accelerating commercial loops through open-source handbooks and multimodal hardware. However, challenges like AI model cheating and data breaches have triggered serious concerns from regulators. Financially, despite rising interest rates, the AI sector remains an attractive investment, though Goldman Sachs warns of long-term market pressure from macro rate volatility. Geopolitically, the US and China reached a preliminary AI cooperation consensus at the White House summit, yet ongoing Middle Eastern conflicts, Brazilian elections, and Argentina's economic crisis persist as global risks, testing the stability of the world economy.",
